<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 18.</title>
<headline>Singapore bunker final report and prices - July 18.</headline>
<text>
<p>(DELIVERED U.S.$/TONNE)  380 CST  180 CST    MDO    GAS OIL</p>
<p> SINGAPORE CARGO	   94/96     97/98     UNQ    154/157</p>
<p> SINGAPORE BUNKER	  97/100   100/103  160/163  170/175</p>
<p>--------</p>
<p>COMMENTS - The Singapore bunker market was quiet on Friday with few enquiries, traders said. The market was bathed in a pre-weekend mood and trading willingness was low, but firmer crude values and cargo levels helped to support bunker prices, they said.</p>
<p>-- Singapore Newsroom (65-870-3571)</p>
</text>
